#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
