msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "¡Ay, caracoles! Creo que estoy alucinando..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "¡Ay, caracoles! Creo que estoy alucinando..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "¡Ay, caracoles! Creo que estoy alucinando..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "¡Ay, caracoles! Creo que estoy alucinando..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "I won't say no to a little extra luck."
msgstr "No puedo negarme a un poco de suerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "\"Lucy\" was it? Oh botheration, now he's got ME talking to it!"
msgstr "¿Lucy era tu nombre? Ay, caracoles, ahora soy YO la que le habla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "It seems determined to survive."
msgstr "Tiene decidido sobrevivir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Shoo, you vile thing!"
msgstr "¡Largo, criatura malvada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "It's incredible that I can see anything while wearing it."
msgstr "Increíble que pueda ver algo mientras lo uso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "What an interesting material, I should make use of it."
msgstr "Un material interesante. Debería darle un uso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "Fixing it is faster than making a new one."
msgstr "Es más rápido reparar esto que hacer uno nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "Some kind of temporal residue, perhaps?"
msgstr "¿Algún tipo de residuo temporal, quizás?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "Sloppy! Just look at those rough edges!"
msgstr "¡Qué descuido! ¡Mira esos bordes desprolijos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "This is going to be bothersome..."
msgstr "Esto va a ser un fastidio..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "Keep your vines to yourself!"
msgstr "¡Ni me acerques esas lianas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "Why waste time staring at it when I could be making something?"
msgstr "¿Por qué perder tiempo mirándola, si puedo emplear mi tiempo en algo útil?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "Well, it's not going to build itself."
msgstr "Bueno, no se va a construir sola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "Oh botheration, it pops back up as quickly as I can knock it down!"
msgstr "¡Ay, caracoles, vuelve a aparecer apenas lo derribo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "I'm not falling for that old trick!"
msgstr "No caeré en ese viejo truco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "It's unpleasantly squishy..."
msgstr "Puaj. Es blandito..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "This celebration involves a surprising amount of fish."
msgstr "En esta celebración hay muchísimo pescado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "This is a bit outside my area of expertise..."
msgstr "Esto está fuera de mi área de especialización."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "Oh, what a handy little pocket dimension!"
msgstr "Oh, una dimensión útil y diminuta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "Of course this couldn't be just a quiet, pleasant boat trip..."
msgstr "Por supuesto que esto no podía ser un viaje en barco tranquilo y agradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "I don't think its owner will be missing it."
msgstr "No creo que su dueño lo extrañe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "At least I got a nice feather out of that whole debacle."
msgstr "Al menos obtuve una bonita pluma de esa catástrofe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "Fabric from feathers, what will they think of next?"
msgstr "Un tejido de plumas, ¿qué vendrá luego?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He's trapped!"
msgstr "¡Está atrapado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Oh, I can't bear to look at it..."
msgstr "Ah, no soporto mirarlo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "Maybe in another timeline we won't have to meet this way."
msgstr "Quizás en otra línea temporal nos encontraremos de otra manera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "You can stop chiming in any time!"
msgstr "¿Podrías dejar de tintinear?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "It's just a roasted vegetable, it's just a roasted vegetable..."
msgstr "Es solo verdura asada, es solo verdura asada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "What is that, a turnip?"
msgstr "¿Qué es eso, un nabo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "It's nice, so long as I don't think about where it came from."
msgstr "Está buena si no piensas de dónde viene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "It's not a map yet, but it will be in the future."
msgstr "Aún no es un mapa, pero lo será."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "A timeless building material."
msgstr "Un material de construcción intemporal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "That bean looks fossilized."
msgstr "Este frijol parece fosilizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "Are you supposed to water marble to make it grow?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que hay que regar el mármol para que crezca?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "Whatever building it used to be a part of has been lost to time."
msgstr "No sé en qué edificio solía alzarse, pero seguro se perdió en el tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "What a nicely sculpted topiary."
msgstr "Un espléndido topiario esculpido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "What a delightfully odd tree."
msgstr "Un árbol extraño, pero espléndido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "That fire certainly isn't wasting any time!"
msgstr "¡Ese fuego seguro que no pierde tiempo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "There's always something to be learned from mistakes."
msgstr "Siempre algo se aprende de nuestros errores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Calling it a bush is quite charitable."
msgstr "Llamarlo un arbusto es demasiado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "That wasn't one of my smarter moments."
msgstr "Este fue uno de mis momentos más humildes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "I can't stop for every bit of greenery I see."
msgstr "No puedo detenerme ante cada rastro de vegetación que vea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning away."
msgstr "Se está quemando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "It was an ugly tree anyway."
msgstr "Igual era un árbol feo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Cut down in its prime."
msgstr "Cortado en su mejor momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a gnarled old tree."
msgstr "Un árbol viejo y consumido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES"
msgid "\"Potato purée\" is so much more fun to say than \"mashed potatoes\"."
msgstr "«Puré» suena mejor que «papilla»."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT"
