msgstr "¿Qué rayos has estado comiendo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
