msgstr "¿Qué manjares producirá?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "Somehow it's making me hungry for a big juicy drumstick..."
msgstr "Me está dando antojo de una pata de pollo bien jugosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
