#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
