msgstr "Siempre pensamos cómo sería huir y unirnos a un carnaval."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC"
