msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "We could watch the little ball bounce around all day."
msgstr "Podríamos mirar cómo rebota esa pelotita todo el día."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC"
msgid "It'll let us play if we give it something shiny."
msgstr "Nos dejará jugar si le damos algo brillante."

