msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC"
msgid "Why hello there. Did the other monkeys shun you?"
msgstr "Hola. ¿Los otros monos te rechazaron?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
msgid "Now you and Abigail can play together."
msgstr "Ahora puedes jugar con Abigail."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "I think it's time Abigail and I put an end to your games... for good."
msgstr "Creo que es hora de que Abigail y yo le pongamos fin a tus juegos. Para siempre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
msgid "What a strange creature you are."
msgstr "Eres una criatura muy extraña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
msgid "Today, a pine hat... perhaps tomorrow a pine box."
msgstr "Hoy un sombrero de pino... Quizás mañana una caja."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is plotting something dastardly with that axe."
msgstr "%s está tramando algo vil con el hacha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "He pinky-promised I'd get to ride on his shoulders. Such lies."
msgstr "Me prometió que podría subir sobre sus hombros. Qué mentira."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "The curse haunts you even in death, %s?"
msgstr "¿La maldición te persigue incluso en la muerte, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Fire setting does not seem in your best interest..."
msgstr "Prender un incendio no parece lo mejor para ti..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "We'll get a heart, but are you sure you want to come back?"
msgstr "Te conseguiremos un corazón, pero ¿seguro que quieres regresar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE"
msgid "Hah... you look so silly I almost... well, never mind."
msgstr "Ja... Tienes una pinta tan tonta que casi podría... Bueno, es igual."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST"
msgid "Why stay when you could fly away from this place?"
msgstr "¿Por qué quedarte cuando puedes irte volando de este lugar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE"
msgid "It looks like your condition has worsened, %s."
msgstr "Parece que tu estado empeoró, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST"
msgid "I'll find a way to return you to this mortal coil. If you wish."
msgstr "Encontraré el modo de devolverte a este valle de lágrimas. Si lo deseas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "I'll send you someplace much nicer than this, %s."
msgstr "Te enviaré a un lugar mucho mejor que este, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "Abigail likes you, %s. But she likes Lucy more."
msgstr "A Abigail le caes bien, %s. Pero le cae mejor Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT"
msgid "Oh well."
msgstr "En fin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "Abigail?"
msgstr "¿Abigail?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "You might be sitting on Abigail."
msgstr "Creo que estás sentado sobre Abigail."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Just as well."
msgstr "Lo mismo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Abigail's favorite hiding spot."
msgstr "El escondite preferido de Abigail."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Abigail's favorite hiding spot."
msgstr "El escondite preferido de Abigail."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Is something there?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo ahí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "It seems out of place."
msgstr "Parece fuera de lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "It comes from the depths."
msgstr "Viene de las profundidades."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Life doesn't always make sense."
msgstr "La vida no siempre tiene sentido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "No matter what it consumes, it is never satisfied."
msgstr "No importa lo que consuma, nunca está satisfecho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "It will soon give up."
msgstr "Pronto se rendirá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "There's a slight humming coming from it."
msgstr "Hay un ligero zumbido que viene de ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "Better the worm's light than its tongue."
msgstr "Mejor la luz del gusano que su lengua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "It seems out of place."
msgstr "Parece fuera de lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has developed a taste for blood."
msgstr "%s ha desarrollado el gusto por la sangre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "If you play with fire, you're liable to get burned..."
msgstr "Si juegas con fuego, es probable que te quemes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST"
msgid "You were too good for this world, %s."
msgstr "Eras demasiado bueno para este mundo, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER"
msgid "Don't worry, %s. I'll end it quickly."
msgstr "No te preocupes, %s. Terminaré rápido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER"
msgid "%s's friendship extends beyond the veil."
msgstr "La amistad de %s va más allá del velo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "It is no more."
msgstr "Se fue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "I despise how it skitters..."
msgstr "No me gusta cómo se escabulle..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "Freedom is not for you."
msgstr "La libertad no es para ti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "It is arrested by deepest sleep."
msgstr "Un profundo sueño lo ha detenido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "It prefers to be alone."
msgstr "Prefiere la soledad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "You simply look too delicious."
msgstr "Tienes una pinta deliciosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It is arrested by deepest sleep."
msgstr "Un profundo sueño lo ha detenido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "A small spot of light in the darkness... waiting to be snuffed out."
msgstr "Un pedazo de luz en la oscuridad... esperando a ser apagada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS"
msgid "Nothing goes extinct here."
msgstr "Aquí nada se extingue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "You haven't been a good imp today, %s."
msgstr "No has sido un buen diablillo hoy, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Abby and I know what you did, %s."
msgstr "Abby y yo sabemos lo que hiciste, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Heehee. You're funny, %s."
msgstr "Je, je, je. Qué divertido eres, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "Did you lose a game, %s?"
msgstr "¿Perdiste una partida, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Abby and I will put your souls to rest!"
msgstr "¡Abby y yo acabaremos con tu alma!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is reliable when it counts."
msgstr "%s es fiable cuando importa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG"
msgid "He's becoming more like Krampus."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER"
msgid "Of course it won't work for Abigail."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR"
msgid "You can hear the souls screaming inside."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER"
msgid "If you won't play nice, you can't play with us!"
msgstr "¡Si no te comportas, no puedes jugar con nosotras!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Maybe we should play a different game..."
msgstr "Tal vez deberíamos jugar a otra cosa..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "Hola, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST"
msgid "I'm so sorry, %s."
msgstr "Lo siento, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER"
msgid "You should've stayed hidden in your swamp!"
msgstr "Deberías haberte quedado en tu pantano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER"
msgid "That was very nice of you, %s."
msgstr "Ha sido un detalle de tu parte, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR"
msgid "Sigh. Isn't the regular swamp bad enough?"
msgstr "Agh. ¿El pantano común ya no es suficiente?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW"
msgid "Sigh. Isn't the regular swamp bad enough?"
msgstr "Agh. ¿El pantano común ya no es suficiente?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "Do you have a conscience, %s?"
msgstr "¿Tienes conciencia, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I'd begun to think you were all talk, %s."
msgstr "Estaba empezando a pensar que eras pura palabrería, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "Say \"Pretty Please\" and I might get you a heart, %s."
msgstr "Di: «Por favor», y tal vez te consiga un corazón, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "None of us are above death, %s!"
msgstr "¡Ninguno de nosotros está por encima de la muerte, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "Abigail likes you, %s."
msgstr "Le caes bien a Abigail, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE"
msgid "It looks so fragile... hopefully no tragic accidents befall it."
msgstr "Se ve tan frágil... espero que no tenga ningún accidente."

