msgstr "¡No te me mueras, hamburguesa con patas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
