msgstr "¡Vamos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
