#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK"
