#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER"
